{"id": "en_car_blizzard_p1", "total": 64.119, "segments": [{"text": "If your car stalls in a freezing blizzard at night, do not leave the vehicle.", "start": 0.0, "end": 3.78}, {"text": "Mark needs to survive the freezing night on a dark highway while snow piles high.", "start": 4.3, "end": 7.76}, {"text": "Heavy snow falls fast around the car and blocks every single window completely now.", "start": 8.26, "end": 12.2}, {"text": "The freezing wind howls outside the metal walls as Mark sits trapped in the dark.", "start": 12.6, "end": 16.04}, {"text": "One. Stay right inside the car because it is your best shelter from death.", "start": 16.72, "end": 20.36}, {"text": "A car is much easier for the rescue crews to find than a single person.", "start": 20.84, "end": 23.62}, {"text": "Two. Clear all the snow from the exhaust pipe first before you start anything.", "start": 24.24, "end": 27.92}, {"text": "A blocked pipe fills the entire cabin with deadly carbon monoxide in just minutes.", "start": 27.92, "end": 31.9}, {"text": "Mark wipes the deep snow away from the back pipe with freezing bare hands.", "start": 32.68, "end": 35.4}, {"text": "Three. Run the engine for only 10 minutes each hour to keep warm inside.", "start": 36.04, "end": 39.6}, {"text": "Crack a window just a little bit so fresh air can flow inside safely.", "start": 40.12, "end": 42.94}, {"text": "Tie a bright cloth to the antenna so rescue teams spot the car easily.", "start": 43.74, "end": 46.72}, {"text": "Turn on the inside light at night so passing search crews can see you.", "start": 47.36, "end": 49.98}, {"text": "Mark finishes the safety steps and waits patiently for the morning rescue teams.", "start": 50.7, "end": 53.64}, {"text": "It was the correct survival plan for anyone trapped on a winter night.", "start": 54.08, "end": 56.84}, {"text": "There was just one unexpected problem waiting outside in the deep snowdrifts.", "start": 56.84, "end": 61.119}], "words": [["If", 0.0, 0.3], ["your", 0.